//! The `timeline-scope` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property modifies
//! the scope of a named animation timeline.
//!
//! Initial: none. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
//!
//! Keyword effects:
//! - all: Sets the scope so that any timeline names set on the element or in its subtree are matched
//! only by elements within the same subtree.
//! - none: Applies no change to the timeline scope. This is the default.
//!
//! Grammar: none | all | <dashed-ident>#
//!
//! Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/scroll-animations-1/#propdef-timeline-scope
//!
//! Author guide:
